PatternResult: {shape: class; "+Manual(reason)"}
AssertionScope: "FluentAssertions.Execution.AssertionScope\n(sealed)" {shape: class}
AssertionScopePattern -> IPattern: implementeert
OtherPatterns -> IPattern: implementeert
AssertionScopePattern -> FluentAssertionsSyntax: IsAssertionScope
